	6>Instructions :
	----------------

_ReserveAsChipData:		Reserve a bank in chip memory.
					In	:	d0.w=BANK
							d1.l=SIZE
					Out	:	d0.l=ERROR (iferror occured)
							a0.l=BANKBASE
							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

_ReserveAsFastData:		Reserve a bank in fast memory.
					In	:	d0.w=BANK
							d1.l=SIZE
					Out	:	d0.l=ERROR (if error occured)
							a0.l=BANKBASE
							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

_ReserveAsPublicData:	Reserve a bank in public type.
					In	:	d0.w=BANK
							d1.l=SIZE
					Out	:	d0.l=ERROR (if error occured)
							a0.l=BANKBASE
							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

_ReserveAsChipData:		Reserve a bank that can be :
						24bitDMAable aligned .
					In	:	d0.w=BANK
							d1.l=SIZE
					Out	:	d0.l=ERROR (if error occured)
							a0.l=BANKBASE
							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

_BankBase:				Check base of a memory bank
					In	:	d0.w=BANK
					Out	:	a0.l=BANKBASE
							d0.l=ERROR (if error occured)
							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

_EraseBank:				Erase a previously created memory bank
					In	:	d0.w=BANK
					Out	:	d0.l=ERROR (if error occured)
							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

_EraseAll:				Erase all previously created memory banks.
					In	:	/
					Out	:	/
